<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Check username</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 760px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 0 16px; }
    input { padding: 6px; width: 320px; }
    button { padding: 8px 16px; }
    .status { font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 16px; }
    a { display: inline-block; margin-top: 20px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>4. Check username (boolean based blind)</h1>
  <p>Tells you only whether a username exists. No other data is shown.</p>
  <form method="GET" action="/check">
    <input type="text" name="username" value="<%= username %>" autocomplete="off" placeholder="e.g. admin">
    <button type="submit">Check</button>
  </form>

  <% if (status) { %>
    <p class="status">Username <%= status %>.</p>
  <% } %>

  <a href="/">&larr; Home</a>
</body>
</html>
